 "kind": "recipe",
 "metadata": {
  "alignment": "standard",
  "description": "Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5 Omni (text, image, video and audio input) as lukealonso's ModelOpt NVFP4 checkpoint on three Sparks with vLLM tensor parallel 3 over Ray, a 1,000,000-token context on a 4-bit NVFP4 KV cache (DiffKV Triton backend with WMMA decode), MTP2 speculative decoding and the TP3 virtual-heads mod that pads the attention heads for three ranks. Basis: tonyd2wild's TP3 NVFP4-KV recipe (MIT) and his earlier TP3 MTP repository (FP8 KV variant, offered as an option), on his published patched vLLM 0.21.1rc1.dev85 dev-build image with the upstream mods applied at build time (the mods are derived from vLLM, Apache-2.0). The upstream TP3 repository does not name an image; the published TP2 image is used because the earlier TP3 repository's audio recipe names the same image lineage (vllm-mimo-omni-mtp2-1m-audio-exp:20260620). The two-Spark recipe by the same creator is mimo-v2-5-omni-nvfp4-tonyd2wild-vllm-dual. Upstream figures (about 36 tok/s decode, 10.59M-token KV pool at 1M context with NVFP4 KV against 3.06M with FP8 KV) are claims until measured here; Vonk physical three-Spark acceptance is pending.",
  "tags": [
   "audio",
   "diffkv",
   "mimo-v2.5",
   "mtp",
   "multimodal",
   "nvfp4",
   "nvfp4-kv",
   "ray",
   "reasoning",
   "spark",
   "tool-use",
   "tp3",
   "video",
   "vllm"
  ],
  "title": "MiMo V2.5 Omni NVFP4 vLLM three Sparks"
 },
